\f1\fs22 In the combined disciplines of cosmology, quantum physics and pancake batter science, there is no study more baffling, and none that has driven into imbecility more doctors of philosophy in lab coats and kitchen aprons than calceoaphanology\'97the study of missing footwear or, by what could realistically be funded, missing socks. The problem is so multiversally irritating that research inevitably emerges in any sufficiently  advanced \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
civilisation that is anatomically cursed with feet, technologically afflicted by washing machines, and culturally averse to mismatched knitted goods.\
